              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "lorie"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Great Pie!!\nI made this pie yesterday for a pie contest, at our eagles club. And it took BEST PIE OVER ALL! The only thing differnt I did, was while the strawberries were still warm I added 1/2 a packet of strawberry jello. Because the strawberries was a little to runny for me. But changed nothing els."
          },
